  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Preview release of dependency-free SVG, HTML, PNG, GIF, JPEG, BMP, PPM, and baseline TIFF rendering for charts, visual blocks, report tables, metric cards, visual grids, wallpapers, and topology diagrams. Includes shared raster buffers, stream/file/byte-array raster export helpers, reusable image composition with explicit stream/file output, non-throwing image loaders, annotation lines and callouts, PNG compression options, static HTML grids and mosaic panel spans, expressive themes, dashboard presets, brand kits, font stacks, palettes, role-based text, grid headers, per-series and point-level data-label styling, point callouts, per-series legend visibility, semantic series roles, pictorial symbols, Isotype and people-infographic galleries, dashboard and word-cloud galleries, sunburst, pictorial, progress-bar, hexbin heatmap, reusable heatmap row models, wrapped/customizable pictorial symbols, custom donut center text/ring thickness, KPI rings, legend placement controls, pasted hex palettes, shared SVG/PNG compact number formatting, scoped inline SVG IDs, Native AOT validation, and fail-fast validation for specialized chart/topology data.",
